end
end
fn planpublish sent ulong start long to void
while gt padd sub sent mapget lh 5 128 8 get ps 6 get launch 10 bound 9223372036854775807
plantimeout start
cpurelax
end
note Invalidate all owned slots, copy all bodies, then publish aligned headers.
for i ulong get ps 6 bound 9223372036854775807
r = checked mapset lh 3 mul rem add sent i get launch 10 64 4 1
end
cpufence
plancopy sent
cpufence
for i ulong get ps 6 bound 9223372036854775807
r = checked mapset lh 3 mul rem add sent i get launch 10 64 4 0x00021502
end
cpufence
r = checked mapset lh 5 56 8 add sent get ps 6
cpufence
r = checked mapset long get launch 8 get launch 9 8 sub add sent get ps 6 1
end
fn recordtoken step ulong tok long to void
if ge add step 1 get ps 7
idx = sub add step 1 get ps 7
r = checked mapset long get ps 22 mul idx 4 4 mapget tok bufoffset get ps 9 4
end
end
fn printids to void
emit planids
for i ulong get ps 8 bound 9223372036854775807
if ne i 0
emit plancomma
end
